OL,3,GNEWSAWoman says divorcing controlling
OL,4,Ahusband cost her #105k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who endured years of abusive
OL,7,Fcontrolling behaviour by her ex-husband
OL,8,Fsays it has cost her more than #105,000
OL,9,Fto divorce him.
OL,11,FAnnabelle Boucher, 48, from Somerset,
OL,12,Fwants the law changed after she paid
OL,13,F#75,000 to David Rogers, 61, despite
OL,14,Fhim admitting to coercive and
OL,15,Fcontrolling behaviour, and legal costs.
OL,17,F"I thought being stuck in this
OL,18,Frelationship I couldn't get out of
OL,19,Fwould be highlighted within the divorce
OL,20,Fprocedure," Boucher said. "But the
OL,21,Fdivorce law doesn't take into account
OL,22,Fthe fact that he was a criminal."
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
